  "citation": "Johnson K M; Schneider B; Mintrop L; Wallace D W R (1998): CO2, Hydrographic, and Chemical Data Obtained During the R/V Meteor Cruise 22/5 in the South Atlantic Ocean (WOCE Section A10, December 1992-January 1993). CDIAC. Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/OTG.NDP066",
  "dataset": {
    "@context": "http://schema.org/",
